@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About QCGO";
}

<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-10">
            <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">About QCGO</h1>
            <p class="lead">QCGO is a lightweight city guide web application built to help residents and visitors discover notable places across Quezon City. It showcases attractions, dining, shopping, and other points of interest organized by district and category.</p>

            <h3 class="mt-4">How it was made</h3>
            <p>This application is built with ASP.NET Core and uses server-rendered Razor views for the UI. The project follows a simple services-based architecture where spot data is supplied via the application's services layer. Static assets (images, scripts, styles) are served from `wwwroot` and district imagery is organized under `wwwroot/images/`.</p>

            <h3 class="mt-4">Developers</h3>
            <p>This project was developed by BSIT students from Quezon City University (QCU). The team implemented the core features including search, district suggestions, map integration, and this district image carousel.</p>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Nash Daniel Parungao</strong></li>
                <li><strong>Mark Moen Salita</strong></li>
            </ul>

            <h4 class="mt-3">Acknowledgements</h4>
            <ul>
                <li>ASP.NET Core and Razor Pages</li>
                <li>Leaflet (map integration)</li>
                <li>Bootstrap and Tailwind for UI</li>
            </ul>

            <p class="text-muted small mt-4"></p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
